<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/37/msa@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 8. Penggantian seksyen 9"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/37/msa@> .
